public class Driver {static final class Box<T>{private T value;Box(T v){value=v;}T get(){return value;}}record Pair<A,B>(A first,B second){}static <T>T first(T[] a){return a.length==0?null:a[0];}public static void main(String[]a){System.out.println("Box Value: "+new Box<>("Generics in Java").get());System.out.println("Int Box Value: "+new Box<>(100).get());System.out.println("Pair: "+new Pair<>("Balance",4500.50));System.out.println("First Element: "+first(new String[]{"Manav","Karan","Rohan"}));}}
